stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SystemCall: Call open(), read(), etc.
    SystemCall --> Success: Return >= 0
    SystemCall --> Error: Return -1
    
    Success --> [*]: Use return value
    
    Error --> CheckErrno: Set errno
    CheckErrno --> ENOENT: File not found (2)
    CheckErrno --> EACCES: Permission denied (13)
    CheckErrno --> EAGAIN: Try again (11)
    CheckErrno --> ENOMEM: Out of memory (12)
    CheckErrno --> EINTR: Interrupted (4)
    
    ENOENT --> HandleError: perror() or strerror()
    EACCES --> HandleError
    EAGAIN --> Retry: For non-blocking I/O
    ENOMEM --> HandleError
    EINTR --> Retry: Resume operation
    
    HandleError --> [*]: Cleanup & exit
    Retry --> SystemCall
    
    note right of CheckErrno
        errno is thread-local
        Check immediately after error
        Can be overwritten by next call
    end note
